<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following production and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for September 16-22 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		Sept 16-22  Sept 18-24	 TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		   1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    366,271.6   200,708.6</p>
<p> Production	42,217.7    37,219.9     437,839.9   252,888.4</p>
<p> Shipment	  43,357.2    21,959.5     239,514.1   186,416.5</p>
<p> Home Market	  297.7	 372.1	 3,432.0     4,925.2</p>
<p> Stocks/close   364,341.6   215,596.9</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
